{"words": [{"text": "وَكَذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "And thus"}, {"text": "جَعَلْنَـٰكُمْ", "translation": "We made you"}, {"text": "أُمَّةًۭ", "translation": "a community"}, {"text": "وَسَطًۭا", "translation": "(of the) middle way"}, {"text": "لِّتَكُونُوا۟", "translation": "so that you will be"}, {"text": "شُهَدَآءَ", "translation": "witnesses"}, {"text": "عَلَى", "translation": "over"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّاسِ", "translation": "the mankind"}, {"text": "وَيَكُونَ", "translation": "and will be"}, {"text": "ٱلرَّسُولُ", "translation": "the Messenger"}, {"text": "عَلَيْكُمْ", "translation": "on you"}, {"text": "شَهِيدًۭا ۗ", "translation": "a witness"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "And not"}, {"text": "جَعَلْنَا", "translation": "We made"}, {"text": "ٱلْقِبْلَةَ", "translation": "the direction of prayer"}, {"text": "ٱلَّتِى", "translation": "which"}, {"text": "كُنتَ", "translation": "you were used to"}, {"text": "عَلَيْهَآ", "translation": "[on it]"}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "لِنَعْلَمَ", "translation": "that We make evident"}, {"text": "مَن", "translation": "(he) who"}, {"text": "يَتَّبِعُ", "translation": "follows"}, {"text": "ٱلرَّسُولَ", "translation": "the Messenger"}, {"text": "مِمَّن", "translation": "from (he) who"}, {"text": "يَنقَلِبُ", "translation": "turns back"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "on"}, {"text": "عَقِبَيْهِ ۚ", "translation": "his heels"}, {"text": "وَإِن", "translation": "And indeed"}, {"text": "كَانَتْ", "translation": "it was"}, {"text": "لَكَبِيرَةً", "translation": "certainly a great (test)"}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "عَلَى", "translation": "for"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those whom"}, {"text": "هَدَى", "translation": "guided"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ ۗ", "translation": "(by) Allah"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "And not"}, {"text": "كَانَ", "translation": "will"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "لِيُضِيعَ", "translation": "let go waste"}, {"text": "إِيمَـٰنَكُمْ ۚ", "translation": "your faith"}, {"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "بِٱلنَّاسِ", "translation": "(is) to [the] mankind"}, {"text": "لَرَءُوفٌۭ", "translation": "Full of Kindness"}, {"text": "رَّحِيمٌۭ", "translation": "Most Merciful"}], "sahih": "And thus We have made you a median [i.e., just] community that you will be witnesses over the people and the Messenger will be a witness over you. And We did not make the qiblah which you used to face except that We might make evident who would follow the Messenger from who would turn back on his heels.1 And indeed, it is difficult except for those whom Allāh has guided. And never would Allāh have caused you to lose your faith [i.e., your previous prayers]. Indeed Allāh is, to the people, Kind and Merciful."}